Features:
✅ Real-time Hand Tracking: Uses MediaPipe for accurate detection of hand landmarks.
✅ Gesture-based Brightness Control: Adjust brightness by varying the distance between the thumb and index finger.
✅ Contactless Interaction: Eliminates the need for physical buttons or keyboard shortcuts.
✅ Cross-Platform Support: Works on Windows, Linux, and macOS with necessary adjustments.
✅ Optimized for Performance: Runs at 30+ FPS, ensuring smooth and responsive interactions.
✅ User-Friendly & Adaptive: Handles lighting variations and prevents false detections using noise filtering techniques.
